roject it just does the same thing as the Modern theme.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[RenameReproduction.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26324581/RenameReproduction.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117934/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117934/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}